---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Códigos Filosóficos — tecnologia, cibersegurança, inteligência artificial e filosofia."
		/>
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<title>Códigos Filosóficos</title>
	</head>

	<body>
		<header class="header">
			<a class="brand" href="/">
				<span class="brand-mark">&lt;/&gt;</span>
				<span>Códigos Filosóficos</span>
			</a>

			<nav aria-label="Navegação principal">
				<a href="#artigos">Artigos</a>
				<a href="#projetos">Projetos</a>
				<a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<p class="eyebrow">TECNOLOGIA • FILOSOFIA • CIBERSEGURANÇA</p>

					<h1>
						Pensar o mundo.<br />
						Entender os sistemas.<br />
						<span>Escrever o código.</span>
					</h1>

					<p class="hero-text">
						Um espaço independente sobre defesa cibernética, inteligência
						artificial, filosofia, privacidade e o futuro da tecnologia.
					</p>

					<div class="actions">
						<a class="primary-button" href="#artigos">Explorar artigos</a>
						<a class="secondary-button" href="#sobre">Conhecer o projeto</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="terminal" aria-label="Terminal decorativo">
					<div class="terminal-header">
						<span></span>
						<span></span>
						<span></span>
					</div>

					<div class="terminal-body">
						<p><strong>matheus@codigos:</strong>~$ whoami</p>
						<p class="output">estudante, pesquisador, construtor</p>
						<p><strong>matheus@codigos:</strong>~$ cat manifesto.txt</p>
						<p class="output">
							Conhecimento técnico é uma forma de autonomia.
						</p>
						<p><strong>matheus@codigos:</strong>~$ <span class="cursor">█</span></p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section" id="artigos">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="eyebrow">PUBLICAÇÕES</p>
						<h2>Artigos recentes</h2>
					</div>

					<span class="section-number">01</span>
				</div>

				<div class="articles-grid">
					<article class="featured-card">
						<div class="card-meta">
							<span>Cyber Defense</span>
							<time datetime="2026-06-17">17 JUN 2026</time>
						</div>

						<h3>Construindo e analisando um Honeypot SSH com Cowrie</h3>

						<p>
							Como configurei uma VPS exposta à internet para observar ataques
							automatizados, credenciais utilizadas e comandos executados.
						</p>

						<span class="read-more">Em breve →</span>
					</article>

					<article class="article-card">
						<div class="card-meta">
							<span>Inteligência Artificial</span>
						</div>

						<h3>Agentes de IA, autonomia e o futuro dos sistemas</h3>

						<p>
							Reflexões sobre agentes, modelos de linguagem e infraestrutura
							independente.
						</p>

						<span class="read-more">Em breve →</span>
					</article>

					<article class="article-card">
						<div class="card-meta">
							<span>Filosofia</span>
						</div>

						<h3>Nietzsche, tecnologia e a construção de novos valores</h3>

						<p>
							Como a filosofia pode ajudar a compreender um mundo moldado por
							algoritmos.
						</p>

						<span class="read-more">Em breve →</span>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section" id="projetos">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="eyebrow">LABORATÓRIO</p>
						<h2>Projetos</h2>
					</div>

					<span class="section-number">02</span>
				</div>

				<div class="projects-grid">
					<article class="project-card">
						<span class="project-status">ATIVO</span>
						<h3>Honeypot Cowrie</h3>
						<p>
							Coleta e análise de tentativas de invasão, comandos e amostras
							maliciosas em uma VPS.
						</p>
						<div class="tags">
							<span>Linux</span>
							<span>SSH</span>
							<span>Threat Intelligence</span>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="project-card">
						<span class="project-status planning">EM CONSTRUÇÃO</span>
						<h3>Agente pessoal de IA</h3>
						<p>
							Experimentos com agentes, automação, APIs e infraestrutura
							privada.
						</p>
						<div class="tags">
							<span>Python</span>
							<span>LLMs</span>
							<span>Docker</span>
						</div>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section about" id="sobre">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="eyebrow">MANIFESTO</p>
						<h2>Sobre o projeto</h2>
					</div>

					<span class="section-number">03</span>
				</div>

				<div class="about-content">
					<p class="about-lead">
						Códigos Filosóficos é um blog independente criado para documentar
						estudos, projetos e reflexões sobre tecnologia.
					</p>

					<div class="about-text">
						<p>
							A proposta é unir conhecimento técnico e pensamento crítico:
							entender como os sistemas funcionam, quem os controla e como
							podemos construir alternativas mais seguras e autônomas.
						</p>

						<a href="mailto:matheusgagliotti@proton.me">matheusgagliotti@proton.me →</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<p>© {year} Códigos Filosóficos</p>
			<p>Construído com Astro e publicado na Cloudflare.</p>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:root {
		--background: #080b0f;
		--surface: #0f141a;
		--surface-light: #151c24;
		--text: #f3f5f7;
		--muted: #929ca8;
		--accent: #5cffb0;
		--accent-dark: #23c87c;
		--border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		--max-width: 1180px;
	}

	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}

	html {
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
	}

	body {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%, rgba(92, 255, 176, 0.08), transparent 28rem),
			var(--background);
		color: var(--text);
		font-family:
			Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
			sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.header {
		width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max-width));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 28px 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.brand-mark {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 30px;
	}

	nav a {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	nav a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	main,
	footer {
		width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max-width));
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.hero {
		min-height: 720px;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 80px;
		padding: 90px 0;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin-bottom: 20px;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 780px;
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.5vw, 6.1rem);
		line-height: 0.98;
		letter-spacing: -0.065em;
	}

	h1 span {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.hero-text {
		max-width: 630px;
		margin-top: 32px;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.14rem;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 38px;
	}

	.primary-button,
	.secondary-button {
		padding: 13px 20px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition:
			transform 0.2s ease,
			background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.primary-button {
		background: var(--accent);
		color: #07110c;
		border-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.secondary-button {
		background: var(--surface);
	}

	.primary-button:hover,
	.secondary-button:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.terminal {
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: rgba(15, 20, 26, 0.94);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
		transform: rotate(1.5deg);
	}

	.terminal-header {
		height: 42px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 7px;
		padding: 0 16px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.terminal-header span {
		width: 9px;
		height: 9px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #39414b;
	}

	.terminal-body {
		min-height: 280px;
		padding: 24px;
		font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.terminal-body strong,
	.cursor {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.output {
		color: var(--muted);
		padding-left: 18px;
	}

	.cursor {
		animation: blink 1s steps(2, start) infinite;
	}

	@keyframes blink {
		50% {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}

	.section {
		padding: 110px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.section-heading {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-bottom: 55px;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
	}

	.section-number {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
	}

	.articles-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.8fr;
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.featured-card,
	.article-card,
	.project-card {
		padding: 32px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 10px;
		background: var(--surface);
		transition:
			transform 0.2s ease,
			border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.featured-card {
		grid-row: span 2;
		min-height: 480px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		background:
			linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8, 11, 15, 0.98), rgba(8, 11, 15, 0.2)),
			radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(92, 255, 176, 0.19), transparent 20rem),
			var(--surface);
	}

	.featured-card:hover,
	.article-card:hover,
	.project-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		border-color: rgba(92, 255, 176, 0.45);
	}

	.card-meta {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 22px;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.card-meta time {
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	h3 {
		margin-bottom: 18px;
		font-size: 1.55rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}

	.featured-card h3 {
		max-width: 720px;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
	}

	.featured-card p,
	.article-card p,
	.project-card p {
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.read-more {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 26px;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.projects-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.project-card {
		min-height: 310px;
	}

	.project-status {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 50px;
		padding: 5px 9px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(92, 255, 176, 0.35);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
	}

	.project-status.planning {
		color: #f4c95d;
		border-color: rgba(244, 201, 93, 0.35);
	}

	.tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-top: 30px;
	}

	.tags span {
		padding: 5px 9px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: var(--surface-light);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 90px;
	}

	.about-lead {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 3rem);
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
	}

	.about-text {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.about-text a {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 28px;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: monospace;
	}

	footer {
		padding: 36px 0 50px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 30px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 850px) {
		.header {
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 24px;
		}

		nav {
			gap: 15px;
		}

		.hero {
			min-height: auto;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 55px;
			padding: 80px 0;
		}

		.terminal {
			transform: none;
		}

		.articles-grid,
		.projects-grid,
		.about-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.featured-card {
			grid-row: auto;
			min-height: 420px;
		}

		.about-content {
			gap: 40px;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 580px) {
		.header {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.hero {
			padding-top: 60px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 3.15rem;
		}

		.actions {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.primary-button,
		.secondary-button {
			text-align: center;
		}

		.section {
			padding: 80px 0;
		}

		.featured-card,
		.article-card,
		.project-card {
			padding: 24px;
		}

		footer {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
